  "description": "Baek Su-ryeon, the arrogant heiress of Jeil Pharmaceutical, finds her marriage prospects ruined by rumors that she has a 'man-eating' fortune. Desperate, her mother—a fervent believer in shamanism—takes her to 'Master Cheongmok,' a shaman famous for his ability to change one's destiny. Expecting a decrepit old man, Su-ryeon is stunned to find that Cheongmok is an unexpectedly handsome man with a refined aura. Dismissing him as a mere con artist, she remains skeptical until he proposes a strange ritual. As the ceremony begins, Su-ryeon's haughty composure quickly unravels, giving way to an intense, uncontrollable desire that she never imagined possible.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/3587013959)",
